	<div id="collection_page">
		<div id="collection_page_head">
		<h4>チョコエッグ　動物シリーズ鳥編</h4>
		<table style="width: 100%">
			<tr>
				<td  valign="top" colspan="2">
				<a href="img/chocoegg_bird041.jpg">
				<img height="283" src="img/chocoegg_bird041_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- Documents/My Web Sites/mysite2/etc/furuta/chocoegg_bird/img/chocoegg_bird041.jpg" --></a></td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td class="waku_left" valign="top" style="width: 50%">
				01.オオタカ<br />
				02.ミサゴ<br />
				03.ハクトウワシ<br />
				04.アカゲラ<br />
				05.アカショウビン<br />
				06.メジロ<br />
				07.コミミズク<br />
				08.カワセミ<br />
				09.ゴイサギ<br />
				10.コアジサシ</td>
								<td class="waku_right" valign="top" style="width: 50%">
								11.ミツユビカモメ<br />
								12.モズ<br />
								13.ウグイス<br />
								14.スズメ<br />
								15.ルリツグミ<br />
								16.タンチョウ<br />
								17.ブッポウソウ<br />
								18.シジュウカラ<br />
								19.オオハクチョウ<br />
								20.コアホウドリ<br />
								<span class="font_blue">SP.オオタカの飛び立ち</span></td>

			</tr>
		</table>
			<p>
			販売開始時期：2003年10月　価格：162円　発売元：フルタ<br />
			全20種+シークレット1種。ラインナップは鳥類だけのシリーズ。どれも飛んでいるポーズです。海洋堂と決別したあとのチョコエッグは…、と思っていたのですがなかなか良くできています。特にシークレットの躍動感は素晴らしい。<br />
			</p>
		</div>
		<div id="collection_page_main">
		
			<table style="width: 100%">
<tr>
<th colspan="2">01.オオタカ</th><th colspan="2">02.ミサゴ</th></tr>
<tr>
<td><a href="img/chocoegg_bird042.jpg">
<img height="138" src="img/chocoegg_bird042_small.jpg" width="185" /><!-- Documents/My Web Sites/mysite2/etc/furuta/chocoegg_bird/img/chocoegg_bird042.jpg" --></a></td>
<td><a href="img/chocoegg_bird043.jpg">
<img height="138" src="img/chocoegg_bird043_small.jpg" width="185" /><!-- Documents/My Web Sites/mysite2/etc/furuta/chocoegg_bird/img/chocoegg_bird043.jpg" --></a></td>
<td><a href="img/chocoegg_bird044.jpg">
<img height="138" src="img/chocoegg_bird044_small.jpg" width="185" /><!-- Documents/My Web Sites/mysite2/etc/furuta/chocoegg_bird/img/chocoegg_bird044.jpg" --></a></td>
<td><a href="img/chocoegg_bird001.jpg">
<img height="138" src="img/chocoegg_bird001_small.jpg" width="185" /><!-- Documents/My Web Sites/mysite2/etc/furuta/chocoegg_bird/img/chocoegg_bird001.jpg" --></a></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td colspan="2" class="comment">顔や腹の塗装がよくできています。</td>
<td colspan="2" class="comment">タカの仲間としては珍しく魚を捕る。</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th colspan="2">03.ハクトウワシ</th><th colspan="2">04.アカゲラ</th></tr>
<tr>
<td><a href="img/chocoegg_bird002.jpg">
<img height="138" src="img/chocoegg_bird002_small.jpg" width="185" /><!-- Documents/My Web Sites/mysite2/etc/furuta/chocoegg_bird/img/chocoegg_bird002.jpg" --></a></td>
<td><a href="img/chocoegg_bird003.jpg">
<img height="138" src="img/chocoegg_bird003_small.jpg" width="185" /><!-- Documents/My Web Sites/mysite2/etc/furuta/chocoegg_bird/img/chocoegg_bird003.jpg" --></a></td>
<td><a href="img/chocoegg_bird004.jpg">
<img height="138" src="img/chocoegg_bird004_small.jpg" width="185" /><!-- Documents/My Web Sites/mysite2/etc/furuta/chocoegg_bird/img/chocoegg_bird004.jpg" --></a></td>
<td><a href="img/chocoegg_bird005.jpg">
<img height="138" src="img/chocoegg_bird005_small.jpg" width="185" /><!-- Documents/My Web Sites/mysite2/etc/furuta/chocoegg_bird/img/chocoegg_bird005.jpg" --></a></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td colspan="2" class="comment">アメリカ合衆国の国鳥。</td>
<td colspan="2" class="comment">頭頂の赤色や羽の塗装が美しい。</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th colspan="2">05.アカショウビン</th><th colspan="2">06.メジロ</th></tr>
<tr>
<td><a href="img/chocoegg_bird006.jpg">
<img height="138" src="img/chocoegg_bird006_small.jpg" width="185" /><!-- Documents/My Web Sites/mysite2/etc/furuta/chocoegg_bird/img/chocoegg_bird006.jpg" --></a></td>
<td><a href="img/chocoegg_bird007.jpg">
<img height="138" src="img/chocoegg_bird007_small.jpg" width="185" /><!-- Documents/My Web Sites/mysite2/etc/furuta/chocoegg_bird/img/chocoegg_bird007.jpg" --></a></td>
<td><a href="img/chocoegg_bird008.jpg">
<img height="138" src="img/chocoegg_bird008_small.jpg" width="185" /><!-- Documents/My Web Sites/mysite2/etc/furuta/chocoegg_bird/img/chocoegg_bird008.jpg" --></a></td>
<td><a href="img/chocoegg_bird009.jpg">
<img height="138" src="img/chocoegg_bird009_small.jpg" width="185" /><!-- Documents/My Web Sites/mysite2/etc/furuta/chocoegg_bird/img/chocoegg_bird009.jpg" --></a></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td colspan="2" style="height: 20px" class="comment">全身が赤みを帯びているが特にくちばしが目立ちます。</td>
<td colspan="2" style="height: 20px" class="comment" valign="top">目の周りの白い輪が特徴。</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th colspan="2">07.コミミズク</th><th colspan="2">08.カワセミ</th></tr>
<tr>
<td><a href="img/chocoegg_bird010.jpg">
<img height="138" src="img/chocoegg_bird010_small.jpg" width="185" /><!-- Documents/My Web Sites/mysite2/etc/furuta/chocoegg_bird/img/chocoegg_bird010.jpg" --></a></td>
<td><a href="img/chocoegg_bird011.jpg">
<img height="138" src="img/chocoegg_bird011_small.jpg" width="185" /><!-- Documents/My Web Sites/mysite2/etc/furuta/chocoegg_bird/img/chocoegg_bird011.jpg" --></a></td>
<td><a href="img/chocoegg_bird012.jpg">
<img height="138" src="img/chocoegg_bird012_small.jpg" width="185" /><!-- Documents/My Web Sites/mysite2/etc/furuta/chocoegg_bird/img/chocoegg_bird012.jpg" --></a></td>
<td><a href="img/chocoegg_bird013.jpg">
<img height="138" src="img/chocoegg_bird013_small.jpg" width="185" /><!-- Documents/My Web Sites/mysite2/etc/furuta/chocoegg_bird/img/chocoegg_bird013.jpg" --></a></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td colspan="2" class="comment">全体的にグラデーションが美しいです。</td>
<td colspan="2" class="comment">とてもカラフル。水中に飛び込んで魚を捕る。</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th colspan="2">09.ゴイサギ</th><th colspan="2">10.コアジサシ</th></tr>
<tr>
<td><a href="img/chocoegg_bird014.jpg">
<img height="138" src="img/chocoegg_bird014_small.jpg" width="185" /><!-- Documents/My Web Sites/mysite2/etc/furuta/chocoegg_bird/img/chocoegg_bird014.jpg" --></a></td>
<td><a href="img/chocoegg_bird015.jpg">
<img height="138" src="img/chocoegg_bird015_small.jpg" width="185" /><!-- Documents/My Web Sites/mysite2/etc/furuta/chocoegg_bird/img/chocoegg_bird015.jpg" --></a></td>
<td><a href="img/chocoegg_bird016.jpg">
<img height="138" src="img/chocoegg_bird016_small.jpg" width="185" /><!-- Documents/My Web Sites/mysite2/etc/furuta/chocoegg_bird/img/chocoegg_bird016.jpg" --></a></td>
<td><a href="img/chocoegg_bird017.jpg">
<img height="138" src="img/chocoegg_bird017_small.jpg" width="185" /><!-- Documents/My Web Sites/mysite2/etc/furuta/chocoegg_bird/img/chocoegg_bird017.jpg" --></a></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td colspan="2" class="comment">後頭の羽毛が特徴。</td>
<td colspan="2" class="comment">夏はくちばしが黄色いが秋になると黒くなる。</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th colspan="2">11.ミツユビカモメ</th><th colspan="2">12.モズ</th></tr>
<tr>
<td><a href="img/chocoegg_bird018.jpg">
<img height="138" src="img/chocoegg_bird018_small.jpg" width="185" /><!-- Documents/My Web Sites/mysite2/etc/furuta/chocoegg_bird/img/chocoegg_bird018.jpg" --></a></td>
<td><a href="img/chocoegg_bird019.jpg">
<img height="138" src="img/chocoegg_bird019_small.jpg" width="185" /><!-- Documents/My Web Sites/mysite2/etc/furuta/chocoegg_bird/img/chocoegg_bird019.jpg" --></a></td>
<td><a href="img/chocoegg_bird020.jpg">
<img height="138" src="img/chocoegg_bird020_small.jpg" width="185" /><!-- Documents/My Web Sites/mysite2/etc/furuta/chocoegg_bird/img/chocoegg_bird020.jpg" --></a></td>
<td><a href="img/chocoegg_bird021.jpg">
<img height="138" src="img/chocoegg_bird021_small.jpg" width="185" /><!-- Documents/My Web Sites/mysite2/etc/furuta/chocoegg_bird/img/chocoegg_bird021.jpg" --></a></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td colspan="2" class="comment">崖や洞窟の壁に巣を作る。</td>
<td colspan="2" class="comment">食べ物を貯蔵するが忘れてしまうことが多い。</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th colspan="2">13.ウグイス</th><th colspan="2">14.スズメ</th></tr>
<tr>
<td><a href="img/chocoegg_bird022.jpg">
<img height="138" src="img/chocoegg_bird022_small.jpg" width="185" /><!-- Documents/My Web Sites/mysite2/etc/furuta/chocoegg_bird/img/chocoegg_bird022.jpg" --></a></td>
<td><a href="img/chocoegg_bird023.jpg">
<img height="138" src="img/chocoegg_bird023_small.jpg" width="185" /><!-- Documents/My Web Sites/mysite2/etc/furuta/chocoegg_bird/img/chocoegg_bird023.jpg" --></a></td>
<td><a href="img/chocoegg_bird024.jpg">
<img height="138" src="img/chocoegg_bird024_small.jpg" width="185" /><!-- Documents/My Web Sites/mysite2/etc/furuta/chocoegg_bird/img/chocoegg_bird024.jpg" --></a></td>
<td><a href="img/chocoegg_bird025.jpg">
<img height="138" src="img/chocoegg_bird025_small.jpg" width="185" /><!-- Documents/My Web Sites/mysite2/etc/furuta/chocoegg_bird/img/chocoegg_bird025.jpg" --></a></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td colspan="2" class="comment">「ホーホケキョ」と鳴くことでおなじみ。</td>
<td colspan="2" class="comment">もっともポピュラーな鳥のひとつ。顔のつくりも細かい。</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th colspan="2">15.ルリツグミ</th><th colspan="2">16.タンチョウ</th></tr>
<tr>
<td><a href="img/chocoegg_bird026.jpg">
<img height="138" src="img/chocoegg_bird026_small.jpg" width="185" /><!-- Documents/My Web Sites/mysite2/etc/furuta/chocoegg_bird/img/chocoegg_bird026.jpg" --></a></td>
<td><a href="img/chocoegg_bird027.jpg">
<img height="138" src="img/chocoegg_bird027_small.jpg" width="185" /><!-- Documents/My Web Sites/mysite2/etc/furuta/chocoegg_bird/img/chocoegg_bird027.jpg" --></a></td>
<td><a href="img/chocoegg_bird028.jpg">
<img height="138" src="img/chocoegg_bird028_small.jpg" width="185" /><!-- Documents/My Web Sites/mysite2/etc/furuta/chocoegg_bird/img/chocoegg_bird028.jpg" --></a></td>
<td><a href="img/chocoegg_bird029.jpg">
<img height="138" src="img/chocoegg_bird029_small.jpg" width="185" /><!-- Documents/My Web Sites/mysite2/etc/furuta/chocoegg_bird/img/chocoegg_bird029.jpg" --></a></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td colspan="2" class="comment">北アメリカ地方の美しい鳥。メスは黄緑。</td>
<td colspan="2" class="comment">日本で繁殖する唯一のツル。</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th colspan="2">17.ブッポウソウ</th><th colspan="2">18.シジュウカラ</th></tr>
<tr>
<td><a href="img/chocoegg_bird030.jpg">
<img height="138" src="img/chocoegg_bird030_small.jpg" width="185" /><!-- Documents/My Web Sites/mysite2/etc/furuta/chocoegg_bird/img/chocoegg_bird030.jpg" --></a></td>
<td><a href="img/chocoegg_bird031.jpg">
<img height="138" src="img/chocoegg_bird031_small.jpg" width="185" /><!-- Documents/My Web Sites/mysite2/etc/furuta/chocoegg_bird/img/chocoegg_bird031.jpg" --></a></td>
<td><a href="img/chocoegg_bird032.jpg">
<img height="138" src="img/chocoegg_bird032_small.jpg" width="185" /><!-- Documents/My Web Sites/mysite2/etc/furuta/chocoegg_bird/img/chocoegg_bird032.jpg" --></a></td>
<td><a href="img/chocoegg_bird033.jpg">
<img height="138" src="img/chocoegg_bird033_small.jpg" width="185" /><!-- Documents/My Web Sites/mysite2/etc/furuta/chocoegg_bird/img/chocoegg_bird033.jpg" --></a></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td colspan="2" class="comment">ゲェゲェ鳴く。初夏に東南アジアから飛来。</td>
<td colspan="2" class="comment">ネクタイのような模様はオスが太く、メスは細い。</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th colspan="2">19.オオハクチョウ</th><th colspan="2">20.コアホウドリ</th></tr>
<tr>
<td><a href="img/chocoegg_bird034.jpg">
<img height="138" src="img/chocoegg_bird034_small.jpg" width="185" /><!-- Documents/My Web Sites/mysite2/etc/furuta/chocoegg_bird/img/chocoegg_bird034.jpg" --></a></td>
<td><a href="img/chocoegg_bird035.jpg">
<img height="138" src="img/chocoegg_bird035_small.jpg" width="185" /><!-- Documents/My Web Sites/mysite2/etc/furuta/chocoegg_bird/img/chocoegg_bird035.jpg" --></a></td>
<td><a href="img/chocoegg_bird036.jpg">
<img height="138" src="img/chocoegg_bird036_small.jpg" width="185" /><!-- Documents/My Web Sites/mysite2/etc/furuta/chocoegg_bird/img/chocoegg_bird036.jpg" --></a></td>
<td><a href="img/chocoegg_bird037.jpg">
<img height="138" src="img/chocoegg_bird037_small.jpg" width="185" /><!-- Documents/My Web Sites/mysite2/etc/furuta/chocoegg_bird/img/chocoegg_bird037.jpg" --></a></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td colspan="2" class="comment">カモの仲間では最大種。表面はつるっとしています。</td>
<td colspan="2" class="comment">アホウドリより少し小さい。小笠原諸島で繁殖する。</td>
</tr>
			</table>
<table width="100%">
<tr><th colspan="2"><span class="font_blue">SP.オオタカの飛び立ち</span></th></tr>
<tr><td><a href="img/chocoegg_bird038.jpg">
	<img height="283" src="img/chocoegg_bird038_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- Documents/My Web Sites/mysite2/etc/furuta/chocoegg_bird/img/chocoegg_bird038.jpg" --></a></td><td>
	<a href="img/chocoegg_bird039.jpg">
	<img height="283" src="img/chocoegg_bird039_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- Documents/My Web Sites/mysite2/etc/furuta/chocoegg_bird/img/chocoegg_bird039.jpg" --></a></td></tr>
<tr><td><a href="img/chocoegg_bird040.jpg">
	<img height="283" src="img/chocoegg_bird040_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- Documents/My Web Sites/mysite2/etc/furuta/chocoegg_bird/img/chocoegg_bird040.jpg" --></a></td><td class="comment">
	シークレットは飛び立つ瞬間を立体化。躍動感がすばらしい。ノーマルとシークレットで塗装がかなり違っています。</td></tr>
